<section>
  <div class="wrap {{ 'two two--top' if pics.length else 'narrow' }}">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Year 1</p>
      <h2>How a plant grows</h2>
      <p>Ms. Solo began with a short introduction for the parents. Then Year 1 acted out how a plant grows.</p>
      <p>In paper costumes and headbands, the children played the sun, the rain, the plants and the gardener, and sang as they went.</p>
    </div>
    {% if pics.length %}<div>
      {% set collageWide = false %}{% set collageArt = false %}{% set collage2up = false %}{% set collageCredit = "" %}
      {% set collagePhotos = pics %}
      {% set collageWide = true %}
      {% include "partials/collage.njk" %}
    </div>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
{% set pics = ["quarter-1-showcase-2026-roll-and-read", "quarter-1-showcase-2026-showing-her-shapes", "quarter-1-showcase-2026-our-best-work"] | onSite(photos) %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap {{ 'two two--top two--flip' if pics.length else 'narrow' }}">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Year 1</p>
      <h2>Quiz cards and books</h2>
      <p>Next came a quiz game. Families sat down with the children, rolled a dice and asked questions from the cards: what do we plant in the soil? Can a dog grow?</p>
      <p>To finish, families looked through the children's books and projects, and Ms. Solo talked with any parents who wanted a word about their child.</p>
    </div>
    {% if pics.length %}<div>
      {% set collageWide = false %}{% set collageArt = false %}{% set collage2up = false %}{% set collageCredit = "" %}
      {% set collagePhotos = pics %}
      {% include "partials/collage.njk" %}
    </div>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section id="year-1-slides">
  <div class="wrap two two--top">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Year 1's quarter</p>
      <h2>The quarter in 22 slides</h2>
      <p>Year 1's slides from the afternoon go through the quarter subject by subject, with photos from the classroom.</p>
      <ul class="event__did">
        <li><strong>English:</strong> phonics, CVC words, short and long vowel sounds, and building sentences.</li>
        <li><strong>Maths:</strong> counting in 2s, odd and even numbers, and 2D and 3D shapes, with their faces, edges and vertices.</li>
        <li><strong>Science:</strong> plants and what they need to grow, living and non-living things, and sound, with instruments the children made.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {# The slides are Year 1's Canva PDF, saved as one picture per slide (33 MB down to 3.4 MB).
       Each line under "Inside" opens it at that slide, in browsers that follow #page. #}
    <div class="card guidebook guidebook--slides">
      <a class="guidebook__cover" href="{{ slides }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% photo "quarter-1-showcase-2026-year-1-slides-cover", "", "(min-width: 480px) 380px, 90vw" %}</a>
      <div>
        <h3>Year 1 Showcase, Quarter 1</h3>
        <p class="guidebook__meta">22 slides · PDF · 3.4 MB</p>
        <p class="guidebook__do">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--small" href="{{ slides }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the slides</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="{{ slides }}" download="Year 1 Showcase, Quarter 1 2026.pdf">Download</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="guidebook__inside">
        <p class="guidebook__head">Inside</p>
        <ol>
          {% for p in [
            [2, "The afternoon's plan"], [3, "Learning through play"], [4, "Quarter 1"], [5, "Morning movement"],
            [8, "English"], [10, "Maths"], [13, "Science"], [15, "Reading time"], [16, "Friendship"],
            [18, "Cooking"], [19, "Technology"], [20, "Art"], [21, "Games outside"]
          ] %}<li><a href="{{ slides }}#page={{ p[0] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>{{ p[0] }}</span>{{ p[1] }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

